exclusively of graphs or exclusively of graph adjacency matrices, \
ChooseNonIsomorphicGraph[GList] returns the largest list of non-isomorphic \
graphs from GList. ChooseNonIsomorphicGraphs[GList] Given a sequence of lists \
GList, either exclusively of graphs or exclusively of graph adjacency \
matrices, ChooseNonIsomorphicGraphs[GList] returns a list where any two \
graphs originating from different lists are non-isomorphic, but two graphs \
originating from the same list are not checked for isomorphism. \
ChooseNonIsomorphicGraphs[GList_List] Given a list of sublists GList, either \
exclusively of graphs or exclusively of graph adjacency matrices, \
ChooseNonIsomorphicGraphs[GList] returns a list where any two graphs \
originating from different sublists are non-isomorphic, but two graphs \
originating from the same sublist are not checked for isomorphism.", 
